<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>About — UK Student Loan Overseas Repayment Calculator</title>
<meta name="description" content="About the UK Student Loan Overseas Repayment Calculator, a free tool for estimating Student Loans Company repayments while living abroad.">
<link rel="canonical" href="<%= siteUrl %>/about">
<meta property="og:title" content="About — UK Student Loan Overseas Repayment Calculator">
<meta property="og:description" content="A free calculator for UK graduates living overseas who need a clearer estimate of monthly student loan repayments.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:url" content="<%= siteUrl %>/about">
<script type="application/ld+json" nonce="<%= locals.cspNonce || '' %>">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "AboutPage",
  "name": "About the UK Student Loan Overseas Repayment Calculator",
  "url": "<%= siteUrl %>/about",
  "description": "About a free calculator for UK graduates estimating overseas student loan repayments."
}
</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/fonts/fonts.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <header class="header">
    <div class="header-inner">
      <a class="header-crown" href="/">
        <span class="header-title">Student Finance Overseas Repayment Calculator</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="header-nav">
        <button data-href="/methodology" class="header-nav-link">Methodology</button>
        <button data-href="/" class="header-nav-pill">Calculator</button>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="main">
    <div class="container seo-container">
      <div class="page-heading">
        <h1>About</h1>
        <p>A practical calculator for UK graduates who live or work overseas.</p>
      </div>

      <section class="card seo-content">
        <h2>What this tool does</h2>
        <p>
          The calculator estimates monthly UK student loan repayments using your repayment plan, country of residence, gross annual salary in local currency, and the published overseas threshold data.
        </p>

        <h2>Who it is for</h2>
        <p>
          It is designed for UK graduates abroad who want a quick, transparent estimate before checking the final amount with the Student Loans Company.
        </p>

        <h2>Editorial stance</h2>
        <p>
          The tool is independent and not affiliated with Student Finance England, Student Finance Wales, SAAS, Student Finance Northern Ireland, GOV.UK, or the Student Loans Company.
        </p>

        <div class="seo-actions">
          <button data-href="/" class="btn-calculate">Use the calculator</button>
          <a href="/methodology" class="seo-secondary-link">Read the methodology</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="/methodology">Methodology</a>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</div>
<script src="/nav.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
